ct but returned unusable output, call memory_unusable. The catalogue above is already complete: do not call memory_list to rediscover it. If no entry fits, build the missing procedure with function_try early instead of repeating searches."},{"role":"user","content":"Dans persistence.ts, comment writeTourAtomic protège-t-elle le fichier cible lors de l’écriture ? Lis les lignes 13 à 53, cite les sources, et indique les limites."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-98a634d14e53da86","type":"function","function":{"name":"readLines","arguments":"{\"endLine\":53,\"file\":\"persistence.ts\",\"startLine\":13}"}},{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8bc646c26792b9d","type":"function","function":{"name":"listFiles","arguments":"{}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-98a634d14e53da86","content":"{\"omitted\":true,\"note\":\"Already read, result omitted to save context: readLines({\\\"endLine\\\":53,\\\"file\\\":\\\"persistence.ts\\\",\\\"startLine\\\":13}). Full result saved as chatcmpl-tool-98a634d14e53da86; use readScratch with resultId and offset 0 if needed. Cite original sources. Rely on what you noted.\",\"bytes\":2524,\"head\":\"{\\\"result\\\":{\\\"file\\\":\\\"persistence.ts\\\",\\\"start\\\":13,\\\"lines\\\":[{\\\"line\\\":13,\\\"text\\\":\\\"export async function writeTourAtomic(\\\"},{\\\"line\\\":14,\\\"text\\\":\\\"  ctx: WorkspaceContext,\\\"},{\\\"line\\\":15,\\\"text\\\":\\\"  relativeTarget: string,\\\"},{\\\"line\\\":16,\\\"text\\\":\\\"  content: string\\\"},{\\\"line\\\":17,\\\"text\\\":\\\"): Promise<void> {\\\"},{\\\"line\\\":18,\\\"t\"}"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8bc646c26792b9d","content":"{\"result\":[\".tours/.memory/b6f7ac2cdf7e9cfd6f12eaffefc3ebd7676d1e8405d5890db286e7a71df9299e.json\",\".tours/.memory/functions/findSymbolOccurrences.ts\",\".tours/config.json\",\"cli.ts\",\"codetour-schema.ts\",\"context.ts\",\"git.ts\",\"image-validation.ts\",\"main.ts\",\"mermaid-validation.ts\",\"persistence.ts\",\"propos