hape of its result and its key limits. Every successfully executed function_try trial is automatically submitted to post-Tour selection — no remember flag is needed; the selection step considers actual contribution, correctness, documentation and duplication, and consolidation re-executes the exact code and params and re-checks every citation, so only deterministically validated selections persist. Do not wrap a primitive merely to remember it. Combine independent outputs in your Tour logic; never call one memorized procedure from another. Syntactic matches are candidates, not proven semantic relations; report missing evidence as uncertainty. If a stored function was selected for its declared subject but returned unusable output, call memory_unusable. The catalogue above is already complete: do not call memory_list to rediscover it. If no entry fits, build the missing procedure with function_try early instead of repeating searches."},{"role":"user","content":"Où writeTourAtomic est-elle déclarée ? Utilise memory_run avec findSymbolMatches et le paramètre symbol writeTourAtomic, puis réponds avec une référence et les limites."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae97f8df031a4763","type":"function","function":{"name":"memory_run","arguments":"{\"id\":\"findSymbolMatches\",\"params\":{\"symbol\":\"writeTourAtomic\"}}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae97f8df031a4763","content":"{\"result\":[{\"file\":\".tours/architecture_serveur_mcp.tour\",\"line\":30,\"text\":\"      \\\"description\\\": \\\"`writeTourAtomic` vérifie que le répertoire résolu reste dans le workspace, écrit un fichier temporaire dans ce répertoire et synchronise son contenu. Un renommage remplace ensuite la cible ; si le renommage échoue, le temporaire est supprimé.\\\\n\\\\nCe code n’établit pas à lui seul la durabilité après tous les types de panne ni la coordination de plusieurs processus.\\\",\"},{\"file\":\".tours/architecture_serveur_mcp.tour\",\"line\":32,\"t